+**Inputs and Outputs:**
+*   **Input:** A list of $N$ voxels, each defined by integer coordinates $(x, y, z)$ and material properties (albedo, metalness, roughness, etc.).
+*   **Output:** A rasterized image of the voxel scene.
 
